// DNS Query Request To OneLaunch Update Service | T1056 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/dns_query/dns_query_win_onelaunch_update_service.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where dns.question.name=="update.onelaunch.com" and ends_with(process.executable.caseless, "\\OneLaunch.exe")
